old to purchase upgrades from the shop, for effects such as healing, increased movement speed, extra jumps, and even new abilities! Unlock secret items and content for every new game you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/c4eb73f89d00f4bfb46e14af14ece9cb.poster.avif?t=1754314866\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/c4eb73f89d00f4bfb46e14af14ece9cb.webm?t=1754314866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/c4eb73f89d00f4bfb46e14af14ece9cb.mp4?t=1754314866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/0b28f2ad418757726ec2354ef6c52de7.avif?t=1754314866\" data-has-big width=800 height=168 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounters &amp; Alternative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for more than just loot and legwork? Experience the best of both worlds with roguelike progression, challenges, and randomized D&amp;D-style encounters. Every corner could bring a new twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/e05039f74d9d28a38782406c10c85c05.poster.avif?t=1754314866\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/e05039f74d9d28a38782406c10c85c05.webm?t=1754314866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/e05039f74d9d28a38782406c10c85c05.mp4?t=1754314866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Player local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support (and recommended!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Boss fights, and rare difficult hidden ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Challenge Rooms &amp; Mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A good boi</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303630/extras/ce2f1607571cc962e7b81dafa32417ed.avif?t=1754314866\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
